INDEX ./
F README.md            What a .cld file is, what is in the box, the three layers
F INSTALL.md           Adopting the toolkit in another repository
F CLAUDE.md            Working rules for this repo; narrow scope is the point
F cld.conf.example     Every project-specific value, copy to cld.conf and edit
D spec/                The two index format specs
D scripts/             The checkers, the shared config loader, the git hooks
D rules/               Snippets to paste into a host repo
D tests/               Fixture-based test suite for both checkers
